   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Groups",
     "texto": [
      "**Двое, трое, четверо** count groups of people: **двое детей** («two children»), **трое друзей** («three friends»), **четверо студентов** («four students»). With these numbers the noun goes in the plural genitive."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Both, the two",
     "texto": [
      "**Оба** is used with masculine and neuter; **обе** with feminine: **оба брата** («both brothers»), **оба окна** («both windows»), **обе сестры** («both sisters»). In the nominative, the noun goes in the singular genitive.",
      "In other cases both forms change: **с обоими братьями**, **с обеими сёстрами**. The collectives **двое, трое, четверо** are used with certain groups of people and plural nouns; they do not simply replace all the cardinal numbers."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
